00:07:46.973 --> 00:07:47.940
you drain a ganglion cyst.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.710
The way we do it is one of two options.

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:51.420
One, stick a needle in it, drain it out.

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:52.253
Or two,
(water sound boings)

00:07:52.253 --> 00:07:54.120
actually remove the entire cyst itself,

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.710
because that works better in terms

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.840
of having less chance that it recurs.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.400
Doing it this way, you can cause trauma

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.050
to the surrounding area,
including the bone,

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:02.010
ligaments, et cetera.

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:04.560
Also, good to point out, that
you don't have to drain them.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:06.504
They're not bothering you and
they're just there, it's fine.

00:08:06.504 --> 00:08:07.337
(screen whooshes)

00:08:07.337 --> 00:08:08.910
- Yeah, I thought I was
an ENFP but then I took it

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.447
and they made up a new combo for me.

00:08:10.447 --> 00:08:12.060
- [TikToker's Cameraman]
What's the new combo?

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.943
- It's just all of them,
(Mike chuckles) every letter.

00:08:13.943 --> 00:08:15.990
Nope, the Hogwarts house
quiz isn't accurate.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.170
I took it and they just
said I was never accepted.

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.640
Do you know what your love language is?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:21.510
- I think I've taken
(water effect boings)

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.343
all of these.

00:08:22.343 --> 00:08:24.714
- And then I receive
love just through cash.

00:08:24.714 --> 00:08:25.547
(Mike laughs)

00:08:25.547 --> 00:08:26.380
- Through cash!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:27.510
- Yeah, I would, I got my physical,

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:30.090
and they did a "What
blood work are you?" quiz

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.207
and, and I'm anemic.
(camera whooshes)

00:08:31.207 --> 00:08:33.090
- "What blood work are you?" quiz?

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.150
That's how I'm gonna pitch it
to my patients from now on.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.260
Check out my interview

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:39.720
