00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:43.350
Talks all about willpower,
decision fatigue,

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:45.120
basically, how to get you motivated

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.610
to take on anything
you wish to accomplish.

